      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Large image upscale\n\nModels: `kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors` (huggingface.co/hmdlsk/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0-ComfyUI) in `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` and the FLUX.1 VAE `ae.safetensors` in `ComfyUI/models/vae/`.\n\nUse a large input (for example 2048x2048 at 4x produces 8192x8192 from 121 tiles). `tile_batch_size = 0` sizes tile batches from the VRAM that is free after the models are loaded (at most 8) and halves the batch on out-of-memory without repeating finished tiles. `accumulation_device = auto` keeps the FP32 blend buffer (12 bytes per output pixel, about 768 MiB at 8192x8192) on the GPU only when it fits comfortably, otherwise in system RAM. The output is saved but not previewed to avoid a second full-size copy in the browser."
      ],
      "title": "Kandinsky ImageSR",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
